{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The altar of incense of spices</b> In the section of the anointed priest it is written קטרת הסמים, but in the section after it הסמים is not written, because the High Priest is held to greater account in the matter of incense, so spices were added for him. In all the atonements there is written atonement and forgiveness, except for the High Priest, because an inadvertence arising from study counts as intentional."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:40.796366946Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}